docs
examples
tests
*.md
LICENSE

# ...except the files pyproject.toml names as packaging metadata
# (FORGE-648). `readme` and `license-files` are read while the wheel's
# metadata is generated, so `pip install .` inside the image fails with
# "Readme file does not exist" if they are not in the build context --
# which is invisible to CI, where every file is present.
# Keep in step with pyproject.toml; tests/unit/test_docker_build.py checks.
!README.md
!LICENSE

# Claude
.claude

# Misc
pytest-of-*
